            "review_title": "Review at Xoi Che Bui Thi Xuan",
            "review_text": "Manuel D\n115 contributions\n0\nA nice dessert before bedtime\nDec 2025 • Couples\nAll in all a great experience.\n\nThe owner was sitting at the front of the counter and waved us in. The staff was very welcoming. We were looking for a small dessert after a big dinner. This places serves small yet satisfying portions.\n\nWe got their signature che and a portion of flan for takeaway.\nTo our surprise the che was not as sweet as we were used to. That made the experience fresher and lighter.\nThe flan although seemingly small packed a punch. Sitting in a syrup you got that thick flan that stays perfectly consistent on your spoon.\n\nA nice dessert experience before bedtime.\nRead more\nWritten December 1, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
