            "review_title": "Review at Xoi Che Bui Thi Xuan",
            "review_text": "nick g\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam53 contributions\n0\nReal food\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nThis place is both engaging and entertaining. Serving a large range of mainly sticky rice dishes and local beverages, it’s a real eye-opener for a traveler. The sticky rice dishes, though seemingly small in size, are very tasty, quite filling and amazing value. Their banh flan is extraordinary, served with coffee and ice. Nice staff too with super quick service. A favourite in Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
