            "review_text": "emster2029\nSingapore, Singapore1063 contributions\n0\nGreat breakfast of glutinous rice\nJun 2018 • Friends\nBy chance we dropped by here for breakfast at 9am. We saw several people waiting for their take away and decided to try the food. For breakfast they have only a limited selection if glutinous rice selection and their menu has English. We walked away satisfied. They have additional food items at noon and after 3pm.\n\nTheir dessert drinks were refreshing. Recommend you to try them. In fact their frontage were dessert.\n\nLooks like this shop is in Japanese guide book as well.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 17, 2018",
